<STYLE ID="4"><TXSPN>―I made it in time. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">Before the two of them went mad like me, I was able to settle it. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">I killed the people I wanted to kill. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">This is... the unbearable murderous intent. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">This is... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="4">a curse-killing. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">The villagers who saw it all began to raise a clamor at once.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="4">"I-I knew it! A curse-killing! It's a curse-killing!" </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="5">This woman</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">, she's </STYLE><STYLE ID="6" RUBY="すいがん">green-eyed</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">!" </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">"I knew we should never have let an outsider in!"</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="4">"Kill her!"</STYLE><BR>
<STYLE ID="4">"Kill her!"</STYLE><BR>
<STYLE ID="4">"Kill the </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">guest</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">!" </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">That chorus came at me from all around.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="4">The unsightly Noh masks, their rears on the ground, unable to stand, hurled abuse at me. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">What... what is this? </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">Why am I the one who ends up being in the wrong? </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">I'm not the one who killed them, am I...? </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">This settlement killed them, didn't it...?</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="4">Droga and―you people and―the cherry killed everyone, didn't they! </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">Why is it only the people dear to me who keep dying...! </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="7">Kana-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">―my little sister― </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="4">was killed by this settlement...!</STYLE><PG>
I won't forgive this...!
{WAIT "100" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
